{"availability":"available","full":"pierrebrunelle/pixeltable-sticky-notes","name":"pixeltable-sticky-notes","description":"Sticky-notes REST API where titles and previews are computed columns, served with FastAPI · built with Pixeltable","category":"Productivity","language":"Python","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-07T22:38:09Z","updated":"2026-10-08T06:33:30Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://pierrebrunelle.github.io/awesome-pixeltable-apps/#pixeltable-sticky-notes","topics":["ai","fastapi","multimodal","notes-app","openapi","pixeltable","pixeltable-example","python","rest-api","udf"],"demo":"https://pierrebrunelle.github.io/awesome-pixeltable-apps/#pixeltable-sticky-notes","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T15:50:23.340Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T15:50:23.340Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T15:50:23.340Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T07:35:48.074Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-10T19:00:43.877Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-16T15:50:23.340Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["The smallest useful Pixeltable backend: a notes table with a title, a body and an optional tag. Pixeltable keeps two computed columns up to date for every note (an upper-cased title for display and a short preview of the body), and a FastAPIRouter publishes create, rename, delete, preview and list-by-tag endpoints with OpenAPI docs. It is a good first project if you want to see how a Python class becomes a typed, persistent REST API.","Pixeltable is open-source, Python-native multimodal AI data infrastructure: tables, incremental computed columns, UDFs, indexes and serving in one library, running locally or on Pixeltable Cloud.","⭐ Like this example? Star pixeltable/pixeltable on GitHub. It helps other developers find it."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/pierrebrunelle/pixeltable-sticky-notes/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"6badcdd5